Output assets/demo.gif
Require vhs

Set FontFamily "JetBrains Mono"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1200
Set Height 700

Set TypingSpeed 25ms
Hide

Type "turnledger demo --contrast" Sleep 50ms Enter
Sleep 2s

# Barge in mid-stream during the first (resume-continue) mode.
Enter
Sleep 200ms
Type "and multi-region?" Sleep 50ms Enter
Sleep 3s

# Barge in again during the second (drop-and-restart) mode.
Enter
Sleep 200ms
Type "and the team plan?" Sleep 50ms Enter
Sleep 3s

Show
Sleep 1s
